cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoordRippr, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: CoordRippr
abstract: >-
  Desktop and browser application that scans PDFs, including two-column
  journal articles, for latitude/longitude coordinates in decimal or DMS
  form, highlights them on the page, and exports a cleaned CSV.
authors:
  - family-names: Hendren
    given-names: Caleb
    affiliation: Chattanooga State Community College
repository-code: "https://github.com/CalebHendren/CoordRippr"
url: "https://calebhendren.github.io/CoordRippr"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - coordinates
  - georeferencing
  - PDF
  - text extraction
  - biodiversity data
  - taxonomy
